        <Text42 Ref="46" type="Text" isKey="true">
          <Brush>Transparent</Brush>
          <ClientRectangle>0.1,7,0.5,0.2</ClientRectangle>
          <Conditions isList="true" count="0" />
          <Font>Arial,10,Bold</Font>
          <Guid>a6d62d0c15364d2fbcd13fc8a33559be</Guid>
          <Margins>0,0,0,0</Margins>
          <Name>Text42</Name>
          <Page isRef="4" />
          <Parent isRef="4" />
          <Text>BOX 3</Text>
          <TextBrush>Black</TextBrush>
          <Type>Expression</Type>
        </Text42>
        <Text43 Ref="47" type="Text" isKey="true">
          <Brush>Transparent</Brush>
          <ClientRectangle>0.1,7.3,7.5,0.3</ClientRectangle>
          <Conditions isList="true" count="0" />
          <Font>Arial,10,Bold</Font>
          <Guid>3d4ba87c5afd49f5a08a5a219d72ddc0</Guid>
          <Margins>0,0,0,0</Margins>
          <Name>Text43</Name>
          <Page isRef="4" />
          <Parent isRef="4" />
          <Text>PERMIT IS HEREBY GRANTED TO INSTALL THE ELECTRICAL WIRING, DEVICES AND EQUIPMENT ENUMERATED IN THIS APPLICATION SUBJECT TO THE FOLLOWING</Text>
          <TextBrush>Black</TextBrush>
          <TextOptions>HotkeyPrefix=None, LineLimit=False, RightToLeft=False, Trimming=None, WordWrap=True, Angle=0, FirstTabOffset=40, DistanceBetweenTabs=20,</TextOptions>
          <Type>Expression</Type>
        </Text43>
        <Text44 Ref="48" type="Text" isKey="true">
          <Brush>Transparent</Brush>
          <ClientRectangle>0.2,7.7,0.2,0.2</ClientRectangle>
          <Conditions isList="true" count="0" />
          <Font>Arial,10,Bold</Font>
          <Guid>c9a25b7ed1c04f48b41a0f9a5c803a50</Guid>
          <Margins>0,0,0,0</Margins>
          <Name>Text44</Name>
          <Page isRef="4" />
          <Parent isRef="4" />
          <Text>1</Text>
          <TextBrush>Black</TextBrush>
          <Type>Expression</Type>
        </Text44>
        <Text45 Ref="49" type="Text" isKey="true">
          <Brush>Transparent</Brush>
          <ClientRectangle>0.4,7.7,7,0.3</ClientRectangle>
          <Conditions isList="true" count="0" />
          <Font>Arial,10</Font>
          <Margins>0,0,0,0</Margins>
          <Name>Text45</Name>
          <Page isRef="4" />
          <Parent isRef="4" />
          <Text>That the proposed electrical works shall be in accordance with the electrical plans filed with this Office in conformity with provisions of the latest Philippine Electrical Codes, the National Building Code and its IRR.</Text>
          <TextBrush>Black</TextBrush>
          <TextOptions>HotkeyPrefix=None, LineLimit=False, RightToLeft=False, Trimming=None, WordWrap=True, Angle=0, FirstTabOffset=40, DistanceBetweenTabs=20,</TextOptions>
          <Type>Expression</Type>
        </Text45>
        <Text46 Ref="50" type="Text" isKey="true">
          <Brush>Transparent</Brush>
          <ClientRectangle>0.2,8.1,0.2,0.2</ClientRectangle>
          <Conditions isList="true" count="0" />
          <Font>Arial,10,Bold</Font>
          <Guid>cd6745c2648c4dfda91c325e0df98790</Guid>
          <Margins>0,0,0,0</Margins>
          <Name>Text46</Name>
          <Page isRef="4" />
          <Parent isRef="4" />
          <Text>2</Text>
          <TextBrush>Black</TextBrush>
          <Type>Expression</Type>
        </Text46>
        <Text47 Ref="51" type="Text" isKey="true">
          <Brush>Transparent</Brush>
          <ClientRectangle>0.4,8.1,7,0.3</ClientRectangle>
          <Conditions isList="true" count="0" />
          <Font>Arial,10</Font>
          <Guid>fc742838ab2d481c95164e16d47a3472</Guid>
          <Margins>0,0,0,0</Margins>
          <Name>Text47</Name>
          <Page isRef="4" />
          <Parent isRef="4" />
          <Text>That prior to any electrical isntallation, the Owner/Permitee shall submit a duly accomplished prescribed Notice of Construction to the Office of the Building Council.</Text>
          <TextBrush>Black</TextBrush>
          <TextOptions>HotkeyPrefix=None, LineLimit=False, RightToLeft=False, Trimming=None, WordWrap=True, Angle=0, FirstTabOffset=40, DistanceBetweenTabs=20,</TextOptions>
          <Type>Expression</Type>
        </Text47>
        <Text48 Ref="52" type="Text" isKey="true">
          <Brush>Transparent</Brush>
          <ClientRectangle>0.2,8.5,0.2,0.2</ClientRectangle>
          <Conditions isList="true" count="0" />
          <Font>Arial,10,Bold</Font>
          <Guid>e6f7b0d0e1e247d39c239df5bb18e10d</Guid>
          <Margins>0,0,0,0</Margins>
          <Name>Text48</Name>
          <Page isRef="4" />
          <Parent isRef="4" />
          <Text>3</Text>
          <TextBrush>Black</TextBrush>
          <Type>Expression</Type>
        </Text48>
        <Text49 Ref="53" type="Text" isKey="true">
          <Brush>Transparent</Brush>
          <ClientRectangle>0.4,8.5,7,0.3</ClientRectangle>
          <Conditions isList="true" count="0" />
          <Font>Arial,10</Font>
          <Guid>32ee1677f5fd4bffaf2faa28677bc17b</Guid>
          <Margins>0,0,0,0</Margins>
          <Name>Text49</Name>
          <Page isRef="4" />
          <Parent isRef="4" />
          <Text>That for installed electrical capacity of 200 amperes and above at 230 volts nominal and above, a specialty electrical contractor duly licensed by the Philippine Contractors Accreditation Board (PCAB) shall be required.</Text>
          <TextBrush>Black</TextBrush>
          <TextOptions>HotkeyPrefix=None, LineLimit=False, RightToLeft=False, Trimming=None, WordWrap=True, Angle=0, FirstTabOffset=40, DistanceBetweenTabs=20,</TextOptions>
          <Type>Expression</Type>
        </Text49>
        <Text50 Ref="54" type="Text" isKey="true">
          <Brush>Transparent</Brush>
          <ClientRectangle>0.4,8.9,7,0.6</ClientRectangle>
          <Conditions isList="true" count="0" />
          <Font>Arial,10</Font>
          <Margins>0,0,0,0</Margins>
          <Name>Text50</Name>
          <Page isRef="4" />
          <Parent isRef="4" />
          <Text>That a duly licensed electrical practitioner shall be in-charge of the installation and that upon completion of the electrical works, he shall submit the entry of the logbook duly signed and sealed to the OBO including as-built plans and other documents. He shall also accomplish the Certificate of Completion stating that the electrical works conform to the provision of the Philippine Electrical Codes, the National Building Code and its IRR.</Text>
          <TextBrush>Black</TextBrush>
          <TextOptions>HotkeyPrefix=None, LineLimit=False, RightToLeft=False, Trimming=None, WordWrap=True, Angle=0, FirstTabOffset=40, DistanceBetweenTabs=20,</TextOptions>
          <Type>Expression</Type>
        </Text50>
        <Text51 Ref="55" type="Text" isKey="true">
          <Brush>Transparent</Brush>
          <ClientRectangle>0.2,8.9,0.2,0.2</ClientRectangle>
          <Conditions isList="true" count="0" />
          <Font>Arial,10,Bold</Font>
          <Guid>63674f33c1ed45c4be12e6fd5d00db8b</Guid>
          <Margins>0,0,0,0</Margins>
          <Name>Text51</Name>
          <Page isRef="4" />
          <Parent isRef="4" />
          <Text>4</Text>
          <TextBrush>Black</TextBrush>
          <Type>Expression</Type>
        </Text51>
        <Text52 Ref="56" type="Text" isKey="true">
          <Brush>Transparent</Brush>
          <ClientRectangle>0.2,9.6,0.2,0.2</ClientRectangle>
          <Conditions isList="true" count="0" />
          <Font>Arial,10,Bold</Font>
